    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30663" root="عن" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَنُّونُ</span></b> , of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعُّول</span>, is an intensive

epithet applied to the present world (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الدُّنْيَا</span>) [as
meaning <i>The offerer of much opposition</i>]; because
it opposes itself to mankind. (TA.)

